<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD ISRAEL 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD ISRAEL 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia led Israel 2-1 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup Euro/African Zone Group one second round tie on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Result (Isreal names first):</p>
<p>Eyal Erlich/Noam Behr beat Karol Kucera and Dominik Hrbaty 6-4</p>
<p>3-6 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
